{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">AKUMA's BLOODRAIN</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Be prepared to face <strong>hordes of</strong> <strong>akumas/yokais</strong> that are attacking and creating caos in a small japanese village. You're the only ninja alive that can protect this village from the eternal pain.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You must <strong>slaughter all enemies</strong> without mercy before the time is up, the <strong>quicker and bloodier</strong> the better.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Akuma's Bloodrain</strong> is a <strong>fast-paced boomer shooter</strong> inspired by the classics DOOM and Shadow Warrior, where you have to use your <strong>weapons and ninja reflexes</strong> in the maximum level to beat the <strong>waves of akumas. </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Shooting:</strong> Blow up the enemies with your powerful shotgun</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Slashing:</strong> Use your claws to tear your enemies in pieces and finish them quicker</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Move Fast:</strong> Dash and climb in high speed to hunt your enemies  before they can even react</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Message from developers</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&quot;We're brothers developing games, and Akuma is the retro shooter we designed to be bloody, challenging, and fun as hell!&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Hugo and Igor, developers of Akuma's Bloodrain</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3692360?t=1749471296","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3692360?t=1749471296","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692360/1adfc6733642e2192f00bcd352c3c00f48456962/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749471296","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/